Hi!

My second 3.4.3 and third overall ascension.
I started this game some time ago, but didn't play for over a month due
to the frustration of losing my t-shirt, SDSM and CoMR after being
attacked by a werewolf and polymorphing. But since I hadn't used my
castle /oW yet, I was able to reaquire the stuff without a hassle.
Other events of note: Went for the protection racket in the beginning,
and minetown was a bones file of a wizard, where I got a CoMR. Only one
generated in the dungeon. Having done the protection racket turned out
worth it after getting stuck between a werejackal and his summoned
minions in a minetown corridor, but they did not hit me. Which was a
good thing, as I was still only level 2.
On astral plane I used the Staff of Aesculapius to slaughter more or
less everyone who was against me, I have to admit it is a very, very
nice weapon.
And for the ascension-trick I brought Famine and Pestilence with me to
the demigodbar. *eg* (beating down Pestilence was surprisingly easy,
though being a healer with cure sickness does help. Taming the riders
took some tries, though.)
On the altar I wished for a magic whistle to speed things up. :)


